   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s016-u009",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "ராஜ",
    "text": "That is exactly why I say one must not enter the inner chamber at midnight!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-016.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-016.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s016-d006",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 31,
       "printed_page": 30
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s016-u010",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "மனோ",
    "text": "Rajapriya! Do you know the news?",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-016.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-016.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s016-d007",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 31,
       "printed_page": 30
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s016-u011",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "ராஜ",
    "text": "I came knowing your news, didn't I! Manohara! This is a time to be on guard. Do not be deceived! A little while ago the princess was Yama himself coming to kill you!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-016.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-016.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s016-d008",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 31,
       "printed_page": 30
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "`எமன்` is retained as Yama rather than generalized to 'death'."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s016-u012",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "விஜ",
    "text": "I too have a heart. Those who possess a good heart make a mistake only once.",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-016.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-016.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s016-d009",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 31,
       "printed_page": 30
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s016-u013",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "மனோ",
    "text": "Vijaya! You are one who must live. More than that, you are under my protection... I cannot permit such disastrous acts.",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-016.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-016.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s016-d010",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 31,
       "printed_page": 30
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s016-u014",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "விஜ",
    "text": "Life is not your slave. It was given by the Lord.",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-016.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-016.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s016-d011",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
